@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Select a filter
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "User" as user
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (UI components)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoFilterComponent" as filter
  participant "TodoPageComponent" as page
  participant "TodoListComponent" as list
end box
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "Router" as router
  participant "TodoStore" as store
end box
user -> filter : Select "Active" (or "Done")
filter -> page : Emit selected filter
page -> router : Navigate to / with query filter=active (filter=done for Done, no query for All) (L2-006)
router --> page : URL updated, no full page reload (L2-006)
router -> page : Bind query parameter filter to the page input
page -> store : Set filter signal
store -> store : Recompute visibleTodos for the filter (L2-006)
store --> list : Only active tasks (or only completed tasks) (L2-006)
page --> filter : Selected filter
filter --> user : Move selection indicator, set aria-pressed (L2-006)
note over page, store : Browser back and forward re-run the same binding from the URL (L2-006)
opt Task completed while "Active" is selected
  store -> store : Mark task completed
  store --> list : Task leaves the list after its completion animation, within 600 ms (L2-006)
end
@enduml
